  "bio": "Roland Pacheco is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Hawi, United States, who specializes in tribal style tattoos. Known for his appearances on Inkmaster Season 4 and as a part of the illustrious Squid Ink Team on Virgin Voyages, Roland is a true master of his craft, ensuring every tattoo is a work of art. His professionalism is evident in his exceptional skills and meticulous attention to detail.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Hawi, Hawaii, United States\n\n6th gen Polynesian from Hawaii\nInkmaster Season 4\nVirgin Voyages 🧜‍♀️ Squid Ink Team OG\nTO MAKE AN APPOINTMENT\n🔻🔻🔻🔻🔻🔻🔻🔻🔻🔻",
